COLLECTION  (src/library/Collection.*, Qt Sql / QSQLITE)
  - ~/.local/share/JohnnyGentoo Studios/CyanBeat/collection.db, WAL +
    synchronous=NORMAL (no fsync per play count on the spinning disk).
  - tracks(path PK, tags, duration, size, mtime, play_count, last_played, rating,
    added_at); playlists(id, name); playlist_items(playlist_id, pos, path) with
    ON DELETE CASCADE. Schema version in PRAGMA user_version.
  - Replaces the phase-0 library.bin cache (deleted on first run).
  - Rescans diff against memory: only new/changed rows are written, removed paths
    deleted; an unchanged rescan emits nothing (view isn't reset).

PLAYLISTS
  - Entries are stored BY PATH. A song whose file is gone (moved, mid-sync) is
    hidden but keeps its slot; reorder/remove only touch the entries you can see,
    so it reappears in the same place when the file comes back. This matters for
    phone sync later.
  - Sidebar (ui/SourceList): LIBRARY › Music, DEVICES, PLAYLISTS › 3 smart lists +
    user playlists. Drop songs on a playlist = append; on empty space / the header =
    new playlist. Inline rename (F2 / right-click), Delete with confirmation.
  - Table: drag rows within a playlist to reorder; only enabled when the playlist
    is shown unfiltered in # order (otherwise the drop position is ambiguous).
    Delete/Backspace removes from the playlist. Drags also carry file URLs, so
    songs can be dropped into a file manager.

SMART LISTS
  - Recently Added: last 30 days, never fewer than the newest 25.
  - Recently Played: last 100 by last_played.
  - Top 25 Most Played.

STATS
  - Play counts at min(half the song, 4 min) of playback, or at EOS for songs that
    end between ticks. Last Played alongside.
  - Ratings: 0–5 stars, click in the Rating column (click the last lit star again
    to step down), or right-click › Rating for a selection.
  - Date Added = the file's birth time (statx), else ctime: on the first import your
    3,821 songs got real dates (2024-05 → 2026-09) instead of all "today".
  - Stats survive tag re-reads (changed size/mtime) and restarts.
  - Columns: #, Rating, Plays, Date Added, Last Played added; header right-click
    toggles columns. Header state key bumped to window/trackHeader2.

FIXES
  - Rating cells drew the number under the stars → background drawn via
    CE_ItemViewItem with the text stripped.
  - Snapshot hook now fires after the scan, not on the first (possibly empty) frame;
    CYANBEAT_SNAPSHOT_SOURCE=playlist:<id>|smart:<n> for headless checks.

VERIFIED
  - tests/collection_test (17 checks, throwaway folder of empty .mp3s): playlist
    order, missing-file slot kept across reorder and return, remove by visible
    position, rename, delete cascade, play count/rating/last played across restart
    and across a tag re-read.
  - engine_smoke still passes.
  - Offscreen renders: playlist view (# column, scoped browser, summary), Top 25
    with ratings.
  - NOT verified by me: mouse drag-and-drop, inline rename, context menus, rating
    clicks (need a real session).

NEXT
